request.prompt:
Use case: ui-mockup. Generate one exceptionally polished, fully populated Chinese enterprise SaaS application screenshot for Client Reach, an AI procurement-intelligence and B2B customer acquisition CRM. This is image 1 of one coherent product design series. Deliver a front-facing flat desktop interface filling a 16:9 landscape canvas, designed at a 1920x1080 viewport and rendered with extremely crisp high-resolution typography. No device frame or perspective. Chinese text is important and must be clean, legible, and spelled correctly.

VISUAL SYSTEM: refined light-mode business software, quietly luxurious, editorial precision. Canvas #F5F7F8, white content, very subtle #E5EBED dividers, graphite #182329 text, muted #718087 secondary text. Restrained teal #168D81 primary accent; small low-saturation blue and amber only in data/status. Chinese type looks like Microsoft YaHei / Source Han Sans, numerals like Inter. 8px rhythm, card radius 8px, buttons 6px. Thin line icons, faint shadows, generous breathing room within information-rich sections. No giant empty metric tiles, no blue-purple gradients, no neon, no glassmorphism. Use carefully aligned real product content.

APPLICATION SHELL: narrow 176px left sidebar, white 64px global header. Brand at top left is a small teal geometric mark with the exact name "Client Reach" and tiny subtitle "AI 获客工作台". Sidebar sections: "工作台", "采购情报", "客户画像", "采购分析", "上下游关系", divider, "客户线索", "产品知识库", "设置". "工作台" selected in pale teal. Sidebar bottom is avatar "林" with "林亦 · 销售经理". Global header breadcrumb "工作台 / 获客研究结果", a discreet search field "搜索企业、采购项目、物料", and top right pill "演示数据 · 2026-10-08".

PAGE COMPOSITION: to the right of the sidebar, a 350px AI research column, a wide 960px structured results region, and a 370px selected-client context panel. These areas have well-designed clear separation. The interface must feel like a finished useful application, not a promotional website.

AI RESEARCH COLUMN: heading "AI 研究助手", small live teal dot "研究完成". A user request in a restrained gray bubble: "寻找珠三角正在采购 PCB、连接器的电子制造企业，优先有公开采购公告的客户。" Below an elegant assistant response with exact leading title "本次研究结论" and short readable lines: "发现 18 家高匹配客户", "7 家有进行中的公开采购", "优先核验华辰电子的交期与认证要求". Compact chips "PCB", "连接器", "珠三角", "采购中". Small collapsed row "已读取 24 个来源 · 3 分 42 秒". A subtle vertical process list "企业发现 ✓", "采购核验 ✓", "产品匹配 ✓", "跟进建议 ✓". Bottom composer with placeholder "继续询问客户的采购偏好…" and small teal send button. Keep chat readable and restrained.

MAIN RESULTS: title "获客研究结果", subtitle "把公开采购信号转成值得跟进的客户". Toolbar "制造业", "珠三角", "采购进行中", and "导出结果". A horizontal low-height metric strip: "候选企业 126", "高匹配客户 18", "公开采购 7", "7 天内截止 3"; each has a tiny relevant icon and subtle separators. Main surface heading "推荐客户", toggle "按匹配度排序". A populated 6-row table with columns "企业与行业", "采购需求", "公开预算", "截止日期", "匹配分". Rows:
"华辰电子科技" / "电子制造 · 深圳" / "高密度 PCB" / "¥128 万" / "10-18" / "92";
"远景自动化" / "工业自动化 · 东莞" / "工业连接器" / "¥86 万" / "10-21" / "87";
"凌锐装备" / "装备制造 · 佛山" / "精密钣金件" / "¥210 万" / "10-16" / "85";
"瑞腾新能源" / "新能源 · 惠州" / "电源模块" / "¥156 万" / "10-25" / "83";
"北辰仪器" / "仪器仪表 · 深圳" / "传感器组件" / "未披露" / "10-30" / "79";
"星河智造" / "智能硬件 · 广州" / "板端连接器" / "未披露" / "待核验" / "76".
Selected first row in pale teal, company monogram avatars and compact stage chips. Rows have enough height and typography hierarchy to be effortlessly scanned. Below the table two useful compact chart panels: "近 30 天采购信号" a fine teal line chart with dates "09-09", "09-19", "09-29", "10-08" and a measured rising trend; "需求品类" horizontal bars "PCB 42%", "连接器 28%", "电子元件 18%", "其他 12%".

CONTEXT PANEL: heading "华辰电子科技有限公司", tags "制造业采购方" and "公开采购". Large modest score "92 / 100" and caption "规则匹配分" with a teal progress line. Important project card: "高密度 PCB 采购", "公开预算 ¥128 万", "截止 2026-10-18", "采购人身份已核验". "推荐产品" tags "HDI PCB", "板端连接器". Pale teal insight block titled "为什么值得跟进" with two short sentences "近期采购品类与您的产品重合。" and "适合切入第二供应商试样。" Mark this block "AI 推断". "拜访前核实" list "交付周期", "认证要求", "试样数量". Footer "企业官网 · 采购公告 · 2026-10-08" and teal button "加入跟进" plus ghost action "查看画像". Keep sources visible and compact. Every element inside the canvas; precise alignment, elegant grid, no clipped text. All displayed data is explicitly demo data.
